Z||000000||Fiero*101||09-23-2001||01:17 AM||||Well it was for me this time<BR>My Alternator went bad and had to get it replaced well since this is the second one in 2 months i did record time of gettting it out and getting it back in<BR>this is how it went<BR>Got up at 8:30<BR>got started around 9 or 9:15<BR>got it out around 10:00<BR>had to go to the parts store and get a different one didnt get back home till about 11:30 then got it all in and got all my rubber clicked in and tire back on by 1:00  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I was like WOW that took me like FOREVER LAST time<BR>well just wanted to share my day<BR>thanks<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Fiero*101||||reg||1
